# Advanced filter trigger

Every **Advanced filter** control in table toolbars must match the Crawled pages
reference. Consistency across tables matters more than per-screen creativity.

## Shared component — always use

```
src/components/AdvancedFilterTrigger.jsx
```

```jsx
import AdvancedFilterTrigger from '../AdvancedFilterTrigger.jsx' // adjust relative depth

<AdvancedFilterTrigger
  activeCount={activeRules.length}
  onClick={() => setShowFilterDrawer(true)}
  onClear={() => setActiveRules([])}
/>
```

Do not hand-roll a new Advanced filter pill, badge, or Clear link.

## Fixed design — never change

### Inactive (no filters applied)
- Pill: `h-8`, `rounded-full`, `bg-white`, `border-gray-200`
- Text: `text-[14px] font-medium text-gray-600`
- Leading filter-lines icon (same SVG as the shared component)
- Hover: `hover:border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50`
- No count badge, no Clear link

### Active (1+ filters applied)
- Pill: `bg-primary-50 border-primary-300 text-primary-700`
- Count badge: solid circle `bg-primary-600 text-white text-[12px]` with the
  **number of applied rules** (never a bare blue dot)
- **Clear** text link immediately to the right:
  `text-[14px] text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 underline`

### Do not
- Use `rounded-lg` instead of `rounded-full` for this trigger
- Use a blue status **dot** instead of a numeric badge
- Put Clear inside the pill or omit it when filters are active
- Relabel to “Add filter” / “Filters” for this control
- Fork styles per dashboard (Found resources, Source inventory, etc.)

## Placement

Lives in the **left** toolbar group with other filter chips (see
`highrise-table` rule). Search / Columns / primary actions stay on the right
(`ml-auto`).

## Panel behind the trigger

Opening Advanced filter may use `AdvancedFilterDrawer` or an equivalent panel,
but the **toolbar trigger chrome** must always be `AdvancedFilterTrigger`.

## Before finishing Advanced filter work

- [ ] Used `AdvancedFilterTrigger` (not a bespoke button)
- [ ] Inactive = white pill; active = primary tint + numeric badge
- [ ] Clear link shows only when `activeCount > 0`
- [ ] Trigger is on the left side of the table toolbar
